[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/semver_solver_deepseek_flash_1/parts/semver_solver/lib/semver_solver.py: Implemented interface library: dataclass-based SemVerError hierarchy with __str__, ComparatorOp enum, frozen data types (Version with is_prerelease/format/__str__, VersionRange, PackageDependency, PackageRelease, ResolutionOutcome), and poly_type Protocol service interfaces (VersionEngine, PackageRepository, DependencySolver).
[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/semver_solver_deepseek_flash_1/parts/semver_solver/lib/semver_solver_impl.py: Implemented concrete singletons: VersionEngine with strict SemVer 2.0.0 regex parsing, precedence comparison (prerelease numeric<lexical, build ignored), range validation/DNF compilation (comparators, caret, tilde, wildcard, hyphen, union, prerelease filtering); PackageRepository with precedence-sorted per-name releases and PackageNotFoundError; DependencySolver with MRV backtracking search, descending candidate order, conflict trail, and ResolutionConflictError that never leaks PackageNotFoundError.
[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/semver_solver_deepseek_flash_1/parts/semver_solver/pretense/semver_solver_pretense.py: Implement interface SemverSolver state machine: package-qualified imports, concrete sampled_from/type/in_set/boolean Domains with *Error gating, model-derived inner returns (version table, SemVer precedence key, release index, resolution selection), strict 1:1 transitions for Version.format/is_prerelease and the three component protocols, seeding transition, fake factory, transition-coverage fake test, and fake Hypothesis stateful test.
[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/semver_solver_deepseek_flash_1/parts/semver_solver/pretense/semver_solver_impl_pretense.py: Implement implementation pseudo-state machine (inner transition overrides binding VersionEngine/PackageRepository/DependencySolver via sut+call_target, package-qualified imports) and real scenario suite covering parse/format/precedence/range trimming/satisfies boundaries and prerelease filtering, repository registration, membership, descending releases, resolver selection, and violating() coverage of InvalidVersionError, InvalidRangeError, PackageNotFoundError, plus both resolution conflict paths; retain the aggregate SUT and real Hypothesis stateful test.
